# Auto-detect text files and normalize to LF（参照桌面库 .gitattributes）
* text=auto

# Dart / Flutter（生成物重跑不再产生行尾假脏——W2 审计 F-2）
*.dart text eol=lf

# Config / docs
*.md text
*.txt text
*.json text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
*.xml text
*.gradle text
*.kts text
*.properties text
*.plist text

# Denylist — binary files
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary